  "body": "W3C i18n wg has [resolved](https://www.w3.org/International/track/actions/548) to request W3C HTML spec to remove them from the obsolete feature list, and this request has been [fulfilled](https://github.com/w3c/html/issues/579) there.\n\nWHATWG's HTML spec should do the same thing, because those elements are useful for writing certain types of furigana. Also, there is at least one implementation (Gecko) which has support of them.\n\nAlso see discussion in #121.\n\ncc @kojiishi @annevk\n",
